<title>NETHERLANDS: TABLE - HES H1 LOSS 22.2 MLN GUILDERS.</title>
<headline>TABLE - HES H1 LOSS 22.2 MLN GUILDERS.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss				22.2  vs   3.3 </p>
<p>    Net profit from ord ops	    1.6  vs   3.4 loss</p>
<p>    Extraordinary charges	     23.8  vs   nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Hes said last month it expected to make a net loss of</p>
<p>22.6 million guilders. Hes Beheer is a transport and storage</p>
<p>group.</p>
</text>
